e&amp;oldid=170070\" title=\"Permanent link to this revision of the page\">Permanent link</a></li><li id=\"t-info\"><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/mwiki/index.php?title=cpp/thread/condition_variable&amp;action=info\">Page information</a></li>            </ul>\n        </div>\n                        <div id=\"cpp-languagess\">\n            <div><ul><li>In other languages</li></ul></div>\n            <div><ul>\n<li class=\"interwiki-de\"><a href=\"http://de.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/condition_variable\" title=\"cpp/thread/condition variable\" lang=\"de\" hreflang=\"de\">Deutsch</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-es\"><a href=\"http://es.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/condition_variable\" title=\"cpp/thread/condition variable\" lang=\"es\" hreflang=\"es\">Espa\u00f1ol</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-fr\"><a href=\"http://fr.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/condition_variable\" title=\"cpp/thread/condition variable\" lang=\"fr\" hreflang=\"fr\">Fran\u00e7ais</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-it\"><a href=\"http://it.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/condition_variable\" title=\"cpp/thread/condition variable\" lang=\"it\" hreflang=\"it\">Italiano</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-ja\"><a href=\"http://ja.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/condition_variable\" title=\"cpp/thread/condition variable\" lang=\"ja\" hreflang=\"ja\">\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-pt\"><a href=\"http://pt.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/condition_variable\" title=\"cpp/thread/condition variable\" lang=\"pt\" hreflang=\"pt\">Portugu\u00eas</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-ru\"><a href=\"http://ru.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/condition_variable\" title=\"cpp/thread/condition variable\" lang=\"ru\" hreflang=\"ru\">\u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-zh\"><a href=\"http://zh.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/condition_variable\" title=\"cpp/thread/condition variable\" lang=\"zh\" hreflang=\"zh\">\u4e2d\u6587</a></li>            </ul></div>\n        </div>\n            